Profound BMS KB
The ProfoundProjects architecture integrates a static JavaScript time planner with Obsidian through local
storage, data structures, and markdown exports for tasks, goals, and events [1]. It uses a client-side conversion 
pipeline to transform planner data
into structured Markdown with YAML metadata, enabling visualization within the Obsidian Projects plugin [1].
To bridge the planner's JavaScript logic and markdown data, use the prompt provided in the response to configure 
Obsidian Copilot for schema mapping and synchronization, or for more details on implementing the system, review 
the documentation in
Obsidian Copilot.
